  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1650706.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>A&iacute;n ha acollit durant tot aquest diumenge la XVIII edici&oacute; del Mercat a l&#39;Antiga, a la pla&ccedil;a de Sorribes Fuster i pels carrers estrets del poble. A la pla&ccedil;a de Gimeno Bar&oacute;n s&#39;han fet les calderes populars d&#39;arr&ograve;s amb fesols i naps. Tamb&eacute; hi havia un roc&ograve;drom.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650691.jpg\" alt=\"p1650691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650692.jpg\" alt=\"p1650692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650693.jpg\" alt=\"p1650693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650694.jpg\" alt=\"p1650694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650695.jpg\" alt=\"p1650695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650696.jpg\" alt=\"p1650696\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650697.jpg\" alt=\"p1650697\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650698.jpg\" alt=\"p1650698\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatantigaain17/p1650699.jpg\" alt=\"p1650699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a97